    <string name="section_bridge">Keyboard layout</string>
    <string name="bridge_info">Press the keyboard button on the floating panel to switch to the keyboard layout. Add key points labelled A, B, C and press play; pressing a point\'s letter taps it. Tap a point to change its key. Holding W, A, S, D or the arrow keys puts a finger down at the joystick\'s center and pushes it toward the edge; letting go lifts it. Put the circle\'s center on the game\'s move stick.</string>
